{number: 48}
{title: Since Jesus Came Into My Heart}
{key: C}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[C] What a wonderful change in my life has been wrought
Since Jesus came into my [G7] heart!
I have [C] light in my soul for which [F] long I had sought,
Since Jesus came [G7] into my [C] heart!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
Since Jesus came [F] into my [C] heart,
Since Jesus came into my [G7] heart,
Floods of [C] joy o'er my soul like the [F] sea billows roll,
Since Jesus came [G7] into my [C] heart.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 2}
I have [C] ceased from my wand'ring and going astray,
Since Jesus came into my [G7] heart!
And my [C] sins, which were many, are [F] all washed away,
Since Jesus came [G7] into my [C] heart!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
I'm pos-[C] sessed of a hope that is steadfast and sure,
Since Jesus came into my [G7] heart!
And no [C] dark cloud of doubting my [F] path can obscure,
Since Jesus came [G7] into my [C] heart!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 4}
There is [C] light in the valley of death now for me,
Since Jesus came into my [G7] heart!
And the [C] gates of the City be-[F] yond I can see,
Since Jesus came [G7] into my [C] heart!
{end_of_verse}
